              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 56,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "MH7TA",
                  "name": "text-content",
                  "width": 1107,
                  "stroke": {
                    "align": "inside",
                    "thickness": 1
                  },
                  "alignItems": "center",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "v2JmIl",
                      "name": "I’m 🇫🇷🇪🇸🇻🇳, I grew up in the 🇳🇱, and worked in 🇹🇳 🇻🇳 and now in 🇫🇷. Art Director for 8 years, photographer by way of cinema. When the sun's up: AD at aaxlo, a digital agency enhanced by AI co-founded with my brother, following a few years running my own design studio (Zalem Industries). The rest of the time: the streets, the camera, and that drive to capture the exact frame a director would have chosen. Street photography is my favorite format because it’s the only one where the backdrop refuses to cooperate. You don't direct anything: you watch, you frame, you shoot.",
                      "fill": "#000000ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 1107,
                      "content": "I’m 🇫🇷🇪🇸🇻🇳, I grew up in the 🇳🇱, and worked in 🇹🇳 🇻🇳 and now in 🇫🇷.\n\nArt Director for 8 years, photographer by way of cinema. When the sun's up: AD at aaxlo, a digital agency enhanced by AI co-founded with my brother, following a few years running my own design studio (Zalem Industries).\n\nThe rest of the time: the streets, the camera, and that drive to capture the exact frame a director would have chosen.\n\nStreet photography is my favorite format because it’s the only one where the backdrop refuses to cooperate. You don't direct anything: you watch, you frame, you shoot.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.34375,
                      "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
                      "fontSize": 32,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": -0.64
                    }
                  ]
                },
